<title>USA: Ballantyne backlog exceeds $12 million.</title>
<headline>Ballantyne backlog exceeds $12 million.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA, Neb. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ballantyne of Omaha Inc said Wednesday its backlog more than doubled over the past 12 months to exceed $12 million.</p>
<p>It cited the number of multiplex theaters plus the growth in popularity of location-based entertainment, which raises demand for projection equipment.</p>
<p>Ballantyne supplies commercial motion picture projection and specialty entertainment lighting equipment.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
